      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 条录音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld recordings synced and transcribed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步并转写了 %lld 条录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld recordings synced.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步了 %lld 条录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld stayed on the Heart bean because they couldn't be checked against the copy on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 条留在了心力豆上：没能和本机的副本核对上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld transcribed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已转写 %lld 条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%%, charging": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld%%，充电中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "127.0.0.1 and localhost mean this iPhone, which has no model server. Use the address of the computer on your network, such as http://192.168.1.20:11434.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "127.0.0.1 和 localhost 指的是这台 iPhone 自己，手机上没有模型服务。请填局域网里那台电脑的地址，例如 http://192.168.1.20:11434。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A day starts at": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一天从几点开始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A secure connection couldn't be made (certificate problem or a proxy in the way).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法建立加密连接（证书有问题，或被代理拦截）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API key (if the server needs one)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API 密钥（服务需要时才填）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %@ over Bluetooth. Keep OpenBean open while it syncs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "经蓝牙大约要 %@。同步时请让 OpenBean 留在前台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any OpenAI-compatible service. A model server on a computer at home (llama-server, Ollama, LM Studio) works too: use its address on your Wi‑Fi. The key is kept in the keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任何 OpenAI 兼容服务都行。家里电脑上的模型服务（llama-server、Ollama、LM Studio）也可以：填它在 Wi‑Fi 里的地址。密钥存在钥匙串里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence is off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 智能未打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence is still getting its model ready. Keep the iPhone on Wi‑Fi and charging, and try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 智能的模型还在准备中。请让 iPhone 连着 Wi‑Fi 并充电，稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple on-device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "苹果端侧模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple on-device model": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "苹果端侧模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's on-device model needs iOS 26 or later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "苹果端侧模型需要 iOS 26 或更高版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio on this Mac is kept for 7 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机音频保留 7 天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio on this Mac is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机音频一直保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio on this Mac is removed once it's transcribed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机音频转写完就删。"
