          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全文"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcripts are sent to %@ on your local network. Audio never leaves this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转写文字会发送给局域网里的 %@，音频不会离开手机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcripts are sent to %@ to write summaries. Audio never leaves this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转写文字会发送给 %@ 来写摘要，音频不会离开手机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Apple Intelligence in the Settings app (Apple Intelligence & Siri), then come back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在「设置」App 的「Apple 智能与 Siri」里打开 Apple 智能，然后再回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Bluetooth in Control Center or System Settings. OpenBean connects as soon as it's on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在控制中心或系统设置里打开蓝牙，打开后 OpenBean 会自动连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on OpenBean in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Bluetooth.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 蓝牙」里打开 OpenBean。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unexpected answer (HTTP %lld). Check that the address is the service's OpenAI-compatible base URL.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "意外的回应（HTTP %lld）。请确认地址是服务的 OpenAI 兼容根地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Until a model is chosen, OpenBean still syncs and transcribes, but doesn't write summaries or the diary.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选好模型之前，OpenBean 照常同步和转写，只是不写摘要和日记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
